    "hall1.aide.after": "Go on through.",
    "hall1.aide.defeat": "Clean entrance!",
    "hall1.aide.intro": "The Maestro hears every entrance. Let's see yours.",
    "hall1.dario.after": "The Treble clef's in Arbor Vale, when you're ready for greener music.",
    "hall1.dario.badge": "The French Violin clef. First of eight. Wear it where the light catches.",
    "hall1.dario.battle_defeat": "Bravo. Honestly — bravo.",
    "hall1.dario.battle_intro": "From the top!",
    "hall1.dario.intro": "No tricks in my hall. Old songs, played well. Shall we?",
    "hall1.dario.lumen_hum": "And listen — your Motes can hum light into dark places now. Lumen Hum. Caves stop being walls.",
    "hall1.senior.after": "He's waiting.",
    "hall1.senior.defeat": "Fortissimo, noted.",
    "hall1.senior.intro": "Last desk before the podium. Show me dynamics.",
    "intro.reed.humming1": "Listen. Under everything — the kettle, the gulls, your own pulse — there's a hum.",
    "intro.reed.humming2": "That's the Undersong. The world singing itself steady. Motes are the bits that grew bodies.",
    "intro.reed.humming3": "I need field ears I trust. Come to the bench — three Motes here need a partner.",
    "lab.cade.counterpick": "Then I'll take the one that BEATS yours. Sorry, not sorry. Notebook says I'm up one already!",
    "lab.reed.after": "How's the little one keeping? Mind its tempo, and it'll mind yours.",
    "lab.reed.bells": "Take these Fermatas too. Ring one true and a wild Mote may hold its phrase with you.",
    "lab.reed.offer": "Go on, then. The brass one's all spark, the slick one's patience, the green one keeps better time than I do.",
    "lab.reed.picked_fanfyre": "Ha — the fanfare. You'll never enter a room quietly again.",
    "lab.reed.picked_rippeggio": "The arpeggio. Patient water wins, you know. Usually.",
    "lab.reed.picked_solfawn": "The scale-singer. It'll keep you honest on the long roads.",
    "lab.starter.choice": "Which Mote will you partner?",
